  "releaseNotes": "Solution Flow Connection Reference Manager - Release Notes\nVersion 1.2025.11.1\nReleased on November 1, 2025\n\nInitial Release:\nThis plugin helps administrators and developers audit and bulk reassign Power Automate Flow connection references, reducing the administrative burden of manually updating connections from user-owned accounts to service principals or system accounts.\n\nKey Features:\n\nUpdate connection references at the unmanaged solution level for targeted governance\nUpdate at the environment level for organization-wide standardization\nUpdate at the individual flow level for granular control",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "XRMToolbox plugin for audit, governing and reassign activities of Power Automate Flow connection references",
